  "notes": "Dawson County (State Auditor), cash basis. Basic statements: governmental funds statement p4 Total Governmental Funds column; beginning/ending are cash basis fund balances (equal total net position). ending_investments 1,432,135 (p3) informational, already within ending fund balance. Governmental Miscellaneous 2,123,210 split into Insurance Reimbursements 1,411,338, Keno Proceeds 184,365 and Miscellaneous 527,507 using the p2 general receipts (sums to 2,123,210). Intergovernmental 4,521,979 equals program grants 4,422,371 + unrestricted grants 99,608 (p2); kept as one printed line. Balance sheet from Statement of Net Position - Cash Basis (p1). Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p5-6), major funds Road/Inheritance/Insurance (p7-8; Sinking Fund had no activity), nonmajor funds via Total Nonmajor column (p19) since more than 6 funds; per-fund nonmajor budget schedules (p9-14) not recorded to avoid double counting. Nonmajor misc split: Lottery Fund misc 184,365 (keno) and remainder 67,439 computed. General Fund Taxes split using p4 General Fund column; budget_final for taxes on third split item only. Zero lines omitted. Read pages 1-19 of 19"
